  "name": "DemoCreate: Declarative Audio-Visual Demo Generation for Software",
  "description": "DemoCreate compiles declarative scenes, narration and actions into silent WAVs, synthetic frames, captions, transcripts and a timed HTML image preview without audio playback. Optional system/Kokoro TTS and ffmpeg produce voiced video. Default word timing interpolates known text over measured clip durations, not acoustic onsets. Supplied annotations can be scored with explicit missing-data accounting, without verifying independence or replacing the absent study. Whisper, Chatterbox and Manim are unwired. Version 0.8.0 remains an unpublished candidate.",
